  "notes": "{軽蔑|けいべつ} is a strong word expressing contempt or scorn for someone.\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{軽|けい} (light, trivial) + {蔑|べつ} (despise) = to treat as worthless\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}する: to despise, to scorn\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}される: to be looked down upon\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}の{眼差|まなざ}し: a look of contempt\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}に{値|あたい}する: to deserve contempt\n\nSIMILAR EXPRESSIONS:\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}する: to despise (formal)\n- {馬鹿|ばか}にする: to make fun of, to look down on (casual)\n- {見下|みくだ}す: to look down on\n- {蔑|さげす}む: to scorn, to despise\n\n{軽蔑|けいべつ} is more formal and literary than the alternatives.",
